# Generation pod environment, pre-declared fallback pin set "fallback-tf" (decision 24/09): transformers 5.15.0,
# the version vLLM 0.28/0.29 use. It needs tokenizers <= 0.23.0 and 0.23.0 was never released, so tokenizers 0.22.2:
# tokenization may differ from training, so every job command carries the laptop's ids_sha256 and a job whose prompt
# ids differ is refused.
# Chosen ONLY at the canary (KIND=gen GEN_SET=fallback-tf bash ops/pod_bootstrap.sh), then fixed for the whole
# run: every job names it (--pin-set fallback-tf). Resolves for x86_64-manylinux_2_28, Python 3.12 (uv pip
# compile). These pins equal v2gpu.engines.PIN_SETS["fallback-tf"] (tested).
